      "writtenOn": "2024-07-11T18:25:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Curious what James thinks, but my preference would be to drop the magic version which pulls the `kNumOperands` and `kNumResults` from teh instruction and just change the call site to be `CheckResultsAndOperands(inst, 0, 2);` in `CheckStore`. A lot less magic that way.",
      "revId": "b14d9fae6d50841091c54a42e62131f3bd7f8133",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8ea3063a_920f5bf1",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/core/ir/validator.cc",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 843,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002241
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-11T18:39:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I could go either way here. Arguably `CheckResultsAndOperands(inst, 0, 2)` suffers from the \"magic constants\" problem, whereas `kNumResults` and `kNumOperands` at least attaches names to the things.\n\nThat said, we can\u0027t use the named constant approach for all instructions (e.g. those with variable numbers of operands/results), so maybe it is indeed better to be consistent and always pass in the values.",
      "parentUuid": "f53bd7ee_08454fb5",
      "revId": "b14d9fae6d50841091c54a42e62131f3bd7f8133",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "52ca2ff3_83de5a3b",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/core/ir/validator.cc",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 843,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000250
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-11T18:46:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I lean towards the always pass in option (the magical version is from the original reference CL, and it works, but I generally prefer more explicit code).\n\nTo avoid the magic constants problem, `kNumResults` and `kNumOperands` could be statics on `Store`.\n\nSo the call would be `CheckResultsAndOperands(inst, Store::kNumberResults, Store::kNumOperands)`",
      "parentUuid": "f53bd7ee_08454fb5",
      "revId": "b14d9fae6d50841091c54a42e62131f3bd7f8133",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
